Traps and early warning for your base in [b]Build 42[/b]. Part of the Dazed suite.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td][b]Dazed Core[/b] (subscribe to it too)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Yes. The server decides every trap[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedDefences[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Defences/images/h-traps.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Defences/images/traps.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Tin-can alarm line:[/b] cans on a string. Rattles when a zombie touches it, makes a little noise and tells you where.
[*][b]Spike pit:[/b] dug with a shovel. Zombies fall in, take a few stakes and stay down for a few seconds.
[*][b]Nail board:[/b] nails through planks. Slows and cuts what walks over it, and can puncture a vehicle's tyre.
[*]Every trap wears out. Right-click it to see how worn it is, repair it or take it down for part of its materials.
[/list]

[h2]Sandbox[/h2]
Whether traps hurt players (off by default), whether nail boards puncture tyres, trap damage, trap durability and how far an alarm line is heard.

